    "message": "share: set close-on-exec after shm_open instead of passing O_CLOEXEC\n\nshm_open() is only specified for O_RDONLY, O_RDWR, O_CREAT, O_EXCL and\nO_TRUNC; macOS 26 rejects O_CLOEXEC with EINVAL, which fails every\ndmn_anon_file() and so every shared export.  Open without it and set\nFD_CLOEXEC with fcntl, as virglrenderer 058959ed and dxmt's\nanon_shm_file already do.\n\nThis host (macOS 15.6) accepts the flag, so the failure does not\nreproduce here; the shared-export tests (shared-*, d3d11/d3d12-sharedbuf,\n9 of them) pass with the change.\n\nFrom varmint patches/d3dmetal-native/0001.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
